@startuml patient_assignment_workflow
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
title MVP Wi-Fi setup, registration and delivery — decisions 15/16 October
actor "Operator\n(button / phone browser)" as op
participant "Digital stethoscope\n(no display)" as dev
database "Flash\n(settings partition)" as flash
database "HAPI FHIR server\n(KIS)" as fhir
actor "Clinical staff\n(server workflow)" as staff #lightgrey

== 1 · Wi-Fi setup (no stored credentials) ==
dev -> flash : read Wi-Fi credentials
flash --> dev : none
dev -> dev : scan networks (SSID list)
dev -> dev : open hotspot (access point)\nwith setup page
op -> dev : phone joins hotspot, opens page
dev --> op : SSID list + password field
op -> dev : select network, enter password
dev -> flash : save SSID + password
dev -> dev : close hotspot
note right of dev : credentials survive restarts;\nlong press >= 2 s in Idle\nopens the setup page again

== 2 · Join Wi-Fi and register (every boot) ==
dev -> dev : join Wi-Fi with stored credentials
note right of dev : join fails →\nIdle + normal Wi-Fi fault,\noffline listening only
dev -> dev : SNTP time sync
dev -> flash : read device-id
alt no stored device-id (first boot)
  dev -> fhir : POST /Device\n(identifier = hardware serial, no patient)
  fhir --> dev : 201 Created, Location: Device/{id}
  dev -> flash : save device-id
else device-id stored
  note right of dev : reuse device-id,\nno new Device per restart
end
dev -> fhir : GET /Device/{id} (proposal, 16 October)
fhir --> dev : Device, with patient if the server linked one

== 3 · Measure and send ==
op -> dev : Start
dev -> dev : listen → BPM\n(no network traffic while measuring)
op -> dev : Stop
dev -> fhir : POST /Observation\nIf-None-Exist: identifier=…|device-boot-session\ndevice = Device/{id},\nsubject = linked patient (only if set),\nLOINC 8867-4, /min,\neffectiveDateTime = interval end
fhir --> dev : 201 Created / 200 existing (receipt)
note right of dev : no receipt → up to 3 retries\nwithin 10 s (14 October),\nthen normal send fault;\nno readback

== Outside MVP · patient assignment on the server ==
staff -> fhir : select Device + its recent Observations,\nlink them to a patient
note over fhir, staff #lightgrey : separate server workflow;\nthe device never selects a patient,\nit only passes on a linked one
@enduml
